  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWPF preview.44 with immutable ProGPU preview.54 and adds portable logical primary-screen, work-area, and virtual-screen metrics for SystemParameters; retains per-monitor DPI propagation, multi-window popup routing, the portable WPF window-icon contract, WebGPU adapter-selection diagnostics, exact transformed and shader-backed stroke replay, native activation, deterministic popup-local input, transparent X11/XWayland visuals, nonactivating windows, bounded render-resource caches, static-frame GPU suppression, Windows OLE clipboard, and the WPFGallery and SharpDevelop acceptance gates.",
